      "name": "Fruteopia",
      "printed_effect": "This card\u2019s name becomes \u201cFruteonia\u201d while face-up on the field. You can only use 1 of the following effects of \u201cFruteopia\u201d per turn, and only once that turn. When this card is activated: You can add 1 \u201cFrute\u201d monster or 1 \u201cFruteification\u201d from your Deck or banishment to your hand. If a WATER Ritual Monster(s) you control leaves the field by card effect: You can send this card to the GY, and if you do, Special Summon 1 of those monsters. You can banish this card from your GY; all WATER monsters you control gain 400 ATK this turn for each Defense Position monster your opponent controls.",
